# Local-only agent layer, restored from the private local-layer backup.
# Tracked on purpose: AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md (minimal public instructions that
# fresh and cloud checkouts need), .claude/settings.json and .claude/hooks/ (the
# guard hook), scripts/check-scope.sh and scripts/test-governance-helpers.sh.
/AGENTS.override.md
/CLAUDE.local.md
/CODEX.md
/GEMINI.md
/.claude/*
!/.claude/settings.json
!/.claude/hooks/
/.claude/hooks/*
!/.claude/hooks/guard-bash.py
/.codex/
/.agents/
/.agent-workflows/
